 DisplayButtons;globalGuiParms;buttons;bool;parms
⍝ Presents any number of buttons together with a message.
 globalGuiParms←##.APLGUI.APLGuiGlobalParms.CreateDefaults
 globalGuiParms.regKey←'MyApp\Kai1'
 globalGuiParms.icon←⎕NEW'Icon'(⊂'File'(GetFile'Sample.ico'))
 buttons←3 2⍴'PDF' 'XML' 'JSON' 'Display' 'Print' 'Cancel'
 parms←##.APLGUI.Dialogs.CreateParmsForDisplayButtons
 parms.focusButton←1
 parms.cancelButton←¯1+⍴,buttons
 bool←globalGuiParms parms ##.APLGUI.Dialogs.DisplayButtons('Which action would you like to perform in reality?')buttons
 :If 0=+/bool
     ⎕←'Cancelled'
 :Else
     ⎕←'Button pressed: "',(↑(,bool)/,buttons),'"'
 :EndIf
⍝Done
